{"id":"dudoan-02","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/dudoan-02/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":995.14,"segments":[{"start":0.11,"end":5.55,"text":"Section 4 You will hear part of a lecture on the ways that","words":[["Section",0.11,0.77],["4",0.77,1.33],["You",1.33,2.59],["will",2.59,2.75],["hear",2.75,3.03],["part",3.03,3.43],["of",3.43,3.61],["a",3.61,3.75],["lecture",3.75,4.09],["on",4.09,4.85],["the",4.85,4.99],["ways",4.99,5.27],["that",5.27,5.55]]},{"start":5.55,"end":13.11,"text":"supermarkets use layout to increase sales. First, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["supermarkets",5.55,6.47],["use",6.47,6.95],["layout",6.95,7.43],["to",7.43,8.09],["increase",8.09,8.55],["sales.",8.55,9.21],["First,",10.17,10.61],["you",11.27,11.47],["have",11.47,11.65],["some",11.65,11.83],["time",11.83,12.23],["to",12.23,12.45],["look",12.45,12.59],["at",12.59,12.73],["questions",12.73,13.11]]},{"start":13.11,"end":62.59,"text":"31 to 40 on pages 6 and 7. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["31",13.11,13.93],["to",13.93,14.21],["40",14.21,14.61],["on",14.61,15.53],["pages",15.53,16.01],["6",16.01,16.45],["and",16.45,16.87],["7.",16.87,17.25],["Now",57.59,57.83],["listen",57.83,58.17],["carefully",58.17,58.67],["and",58.67,59.77],["answer",59.77,60.15],["questions",60.15,60.57],["31",60.57,61.61],["to",61.61,62.19],["40.",62.19,62.59]]},{"start":66.06,"end":71.52,"text":"We've been looking at marketing techniques which influence buying decisions. Some of","words":[["We've",66.06,66.48],["been",66.48,66.58],["looking",66.58,66.76],["at",66.76,66.98],["marketing",66.98,67.38],["techniques",67.38,68.1],["which",68.1,68.54],["influence",68.54,69.04],["buying",69.04,69.58],["decisions.",69.58,70.12],["Some",71.04,71.36],["of",71.36,71.52]]},{"start":71.52,"end":75.2,"text":"All these techniques are related to the way the products are presented in the store.","words":[["All",71.52,71.52],["these",71.52,71.68],["techniques",71.68,72.08],["are",72.08,72.42],["related",72.42,72.74],["to",72.74,72.98],["the",72.98,73.08],["way",73.08,73.26],["the",73.26,73.44],["products",73.44,73.78],["are",73.78,74.02],["presented",74.02,74.4],["in",74.4,74.66],["the",74.66,74.8],["store.",74.8,75.2]]},{"start":76.08,"end":80.28,"text":"For supermarkets, the store layout is not as random as it seems.","words":[["For",76.08,76.22],["supermarkets,",76.22,76.9],["the",77.44,77.62],["store",77.62,77.96],["layout",77.96,78.26],["is",78.26,78.64],["not",78.64,78.9],["as",78.9,79.1],["random",79.1,79.44],["as",79.44,79.6],["it",79.6,79.74],["seems.",79.74,80.28]]},{"start":81.18,"end":85.98,"text":"Decisions have to be made about the arrangement of the aisles where the customers walk, and","words":[["Decisions",81.18,81.58],["have",81.58,81.86],["to",81.86,82.0],["be",82.0,82.12],["made",82.12,82.42],["about",82.42,82.64],["the",82.64,82.82],["arrangement",82.82,83.26],["of",83.26,83.56],["the",83.56,83.66],["aisles",83.66,84.14],["where",84.14,84.4],["the",84.4,84.54],["customers",84.54,84.92],["walk,",84.92,85.34],["and",85.72,85.98]]},{"start":85.98,"end":88.84,"text":"the shelves and so on, where the products are displayed.","words":[["the",85.98,86.1],["shelves",86.1,86.52],["and",86.52,86.76],["so",86.76,86.96],["on,",86.96,87.22],["where",87.46,87.66],["the",87.66,87.82],["products",87.82,88.2],["are",88.2,88.38],["displayed.",88.38,88.84]]},{"start":89.98,"end":95.18,"text":"The most common layout pattern is the grid layout, where parallel aisles are arranged","words":[["The",89.98,90.18],["most",90.18,90.34],["common",90.34,90.68],["layout",90.68,90.98],["pattern",90.98,91.38],["is",91.38,91.82],["the",91.82,91.98],["grid",91.98,92.3],["layout,",92.3,92.78],["where",93.28,93.56],["parallel",93.56,94.0],["aisles",94.0,94.64],["are",94.64,94.78],["arranged",94.78,95.18]]},{"start":95.18,"end":96.62,"text":"in a rectangular pattern.","words":[["in",95.18,95.42],["a",95.42,95.54],["rectangular",95.54,96.02],["pattern.",96.02,96.62]]},{"start":97.64,"end":103.84,"text":"Supermarkets like this layout as it allows them to utilise floor space efficiently by providing","words":[["Supermarkets",97.64,98.4],["like",98.4,98.8],["this",98.8,99.1],["layout",99.1,99.52],["as",99.52,99.98],["it",99.98,100.08],["allows",100.08,100.4],["them",100.4,100.64],["to",100.64,100.76],["utilise",100.76,101.3],["floor",101.3,101.74],["space",101.74,102.08],["efficiently",102.08,102.8],["by",102.8,103.38],["providing",103.38,103.84]]},{"start":103.84,"end":108.1,"text":"the greatest amount of display space proportionate to aisle space.","words":[["the",103.84,104.06],["greatest",104.06,104.44],["amount",104.44,104.84],["of",104.84,105.14],["display",105.14,105.56],["space",105.56,106.2],["proportionate",106.2,107.02],["to",107.02,107.2],["aisle",107.2,107.6],["space.",107.6,108.1]]},{"start":108.96,"end":114.86,"text":"Also, this layout helps to manage traffic flow as it encourages people to all walk in","words":[["Also,",108.96,109.32],["this",109.78,110.02],["layout",110.02,110.42],["helps",110.42,110.76],["to",110.76,110.96],["manage",110.96,111.26],["traffic",111.26,111.7],["flow",111.7,112.16],["as",112.16,112.62],["it",112.62,112.72],["encourages",112.72,113.1],["people",113.1,113.68],["to",113.68,113.96],["all",113.96,114.28],["walk",114.28,114.62],["in",114.62,114.86]]},{"start":114.86,"end":115.68,"text":"one direction.","words":[["one",114.86,115.18],["direction.",115.18,115.68]]},{"start":116.68,"end":122.14,"text":"The main weaknesses of the grid layout are the monotony of rows of aisles and the fact","words":[["The",116.68,116.9],["main",116.9,117.06],["weaknesses",117.06,117.54],["of",117.54,117.9],["the",117.9,118.0],["grid",118.0,118.22],["layout",118.22,118.64],["are",118.64,119.12],["the",119.12,119.3],["monotony",119.3,119.88],["of",119.88,120.12],["rows",120.12,120.48],["of",120.48,120.68],["aisles",120.68,121.4],["and",121.4,121.84],["the",121.84,121.96],["fact",121.96,122.14]]},{"start":122.14,"end":126.42,"text":"that it is easier for customers to rush through the supermarket without lingering.","words":[["that",122.14,122.3],["it",122.3,122.4],["is",122.4,122.56],["easier",122.56,123.04],["for",123.04,123.2],["customers",123.2,123.58],["to",123.58,123.9],["rush",123.9,124.26],["through",124.26,124.64],["the",124.64,124.82],["supermarket",124.82,125.34],["without",125.34,125.88],["lingering.",125.88,126.42]]},{"start":127.94,"end":134.4,"text":"Another layout pattern used by supermarkets is known as the freeform. Here, displays and","words":[["Another",127.94,128.6],["layout",128.6,128.96],["pattern",128.96,129.42],["used",129.42,129.68],["by",129.68,129.94],["supermarkets",129.94,130.56],["is",130.56,130.96],["known",130.96,131.18],["as",131.18,131.4],["the",131.4,131.52],["freeform.",131.52,132.24],["Here,",133.1,133.36],["displays",133.78,133.94],["and",133.94,134.4]]},{"start":134.4,"end":139.72,"text":"aisles are arranged in a random pattern. The good thing about this layout is that customers","words":[["aisles",134.4,134.88],["are",134.88,135.04],["arranged",135.04,135.46],["in",135.46,135.64],["a",135.64,135.74],["random",135.74,136.12],["pattern.",136.12,136.6],["The",137.56,137.7],["good",137.7,137.84],["thing",137.84,138.02],["about",138.02,138.28],["this",138.28,138.5],["layout",138.5,138.8],["is",138.8,139.26],["that",139.26,139.42],["customers",139.42,139.72]]},{"start":139.72,"end":144.78,"text":"tend to spend more time in the store as they wander about looking for different products.","words":[["tend",139.72,140.08],["to",140.08,140.24],["spend",140.24,140.5],["more",140.5,140.92],["time",140.92,141.38],["in",141.38,141.58],["the",141.58,141.68],["store",141.68,142.08],["as",142.08,142.46],["they",142.46,142.58],["wander",142.58,142.92],["about",142.92,143.38],["looking",143.38,143.68],["for",143.68,143.9],["different",143.9,144.2],["products.",144.2,144.78]]},{"start":144.78,"end":151.1,"text":"Its main weakness is the inefficient use of space, which means it is less cost-effective.","words":[["Its",144.78,145.92],["main",145.92,146.2],["weakness",146.2,146.74],["is",146.74,147.28],["the",147.28,147.42],["inefficient",147.42,147.78],["use",147.78,148.22],["of",148.22,148.4],["space,",148.4,148.84],["which",149.22,149.44],["means",149.44,149.7],["it",149.7,149.86],["is",149.86,149.98],["less",149.98,150.26],["cost",150.26,150.64],["-effective.",150.64,151.1]]},{"start":152.16,"end":157.64,"text":"Then we have the boutique layout, where everything is organised around a food specialty, such","words":[["Then",152.16,152.76],["we",152.76,152.94],["have",152.94,153.12],["the",153.12,153.24],["boutique",153.24,153.7],["layout,",153.7,154.14],["where",154.4,154.62],["everything",154.62,154.98],["is",154.98,155.22],["organised",155.22,155.62],["around",155.62,156.04],["a",156.04,156.2],["food",156.2,156.56],["specialty,",156.56,157.14],["such",157.4,157.64]]},{"start":157.64,"end":158.26,"text":"as the bakery.","words":[["as",157.64,157.78],["the",157.78,157.92],["bakery.",157.92,158.26]]},{"start":159.64,"end":164.88,"text":"The advantage of this layout is that it divides parts of the store into smaller areas, which","words":[["The",159.64,159.8],["advantage",159.8,160.16],["of",160.16,160.46],["this",160.46,160.64],["layout",160.64,160.96],["is",160.96,161.42],["that",161.42,161.54],["it",161.54,161.64],["divides",161.64,161.94],["parts",161.94,162.38],["of",162.38,162.6],["the",162.6,162.7],["store",162.7,163.04],["into",163.04,163.3],["smaller",163.3,163.86],["areas,",163.86,164.5],["which",164.74,164.88]]},{"start":164.88,"end":168.26,"text":"may be distinguished by changes in flooring or displays.","words":[["may",164.88,165.08],["be",165.08,165.2],["distinguished",165.2,165.68],["by",165.68,166.08],["changes",166.08,166.52],["in",166.52,166.74],["flooring",166.74,167.38],["or",167.38,167.7],["displays.",167.7,168.26]]},{"start":169.44,"end":173.58,"text":"A further advantage is that this style of layout is attractive to shoppers.","words":[["A",169.44,169.62],["further",169.62,169.8],["advantage",169.8,170.32],["is",170.32,170.94],["that",170.94,171.14],["this",171.14,171.38],["style",171.38,171.74],["of",171.74,171.88],["layout",171.88,172.16],["is",172.16,172.42],["attractive",172.42,172.86],["to",172.86,173.12],["shoppers.",173.12,173.58]]},{"start":173.58,"end":178.72,"text":"Space, however, is not used economically and it is therefore expensive.","words":[["Space,",173.58,174.64],["however,",174.9,175.2],["is",175.4,175.54],["not",175.54,175.76],["used",175.76,176.1],["economically",176.1,176.68],["and",176.68,177.24],["it",177.24,177.34],["is",177.34,177.52],["therefore",177.52,177.94],["expensive.",177.94,178.72]]},{"start":184.29,"end":188.69,"text":"The choice of location of particular types of items in the store is also important.","words":[["The",184.29,184.41],["choice",184.41,184.59],["of",184.59,184.77],["location",184.77,185.29],["of",185.29,185.49],["particular",185.49,185.79],["types",185.79,186.25],["of",186.25,186.47],["items",186.47,186.81],["in",186.81,187.05],["the",187.05,187.17],["store",187.17,187.47],["is",187.47,187.81],["also",187.81,188.11],["important.",188.11,188.69]]},{"start":189.49,"end":195.29,"text":"A supermarket's design aims to direct customers to the store's side and rear walls.","words":[["A",189.49,189.61],["supermarket's",189.61,190.29],["design",190.29,190.71],["aims",190.71,191.19],["to",191.19,191.41],["direct",191.41,191.77],["customers",191.77,192.35],["to",192.35,192.61],["the",192.61,192.77],["store's",192.77,193.41],["side",193.41,194.03],["and",194.03,194.31],["rear",194.31,194.67],["walls.",194.67,195.29]]},{"start":196.15,"end":201.49,"text":"Items typically displayed along the rear length of the store include meat and dairy products,","words":[["Items",196.15,196.73],["typically",196.73,197.01],["displayed",197.01,197.49],["along",197.49,197.87],["the",197.87,198.09],["rear",198.09,198.43],[